cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use lacuna, cite the software and the specific versioned artifact or validation report you relied on.
title: "lacuna: a map of what humanity has not figured out yet"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-25
authors:
  - family-names: Vu
    given-names: Tang
repository-code: "https://github.com/tang-vu/lacuna"
url: "https://lacuna.tangvu.dev"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open-source, provenance-first pipeline and static map for measuring and curating research
  gaps. Its OpenAlex computed methods failed their pre-registered validation and are published as
  negative results. Its sealed prospective PubMed/MeSH ranking remains unvalidated pending future
  outcomes; neither track is presented as validated discovery.
keywords:
  - bibliometrics
  - literature-based discovery
  - research gaps
  - OpenAlex
  - open science
